# Genes

gene-hulk-name = Hulk
gene-hulk-desc = Massive strength and a green tint. Hits much harder, but the genome becomes dangerously unstable.

gene-xray-name = X-ray vision
gene-xray-desc = Thermal sight through walls and darkness. A heavy load on the optic nerves.

gene-night-vision-name = Night vision
gene-night-vision-desc = See clearly in complete darkness without goggles.

gene-haste-name = Haste
gene-haste-desc = Faster walking and sprinting. Conflicts with slowness.

gene-regen-name = Regeneration
gene-regen-desc = Slowly mends wounds over time. Highly unstable.

gene-no-breath-name = No breathing
gene-no-breath-desc = Lungs are optional. Vacuum and asphyxiation no longer matter.

gene-shock-proof-name = Shock immunity
gene-shock-proof-desc = Completely insulated from electrical shocks.

gene-heat-resist-name = Heat resistance
gene-heat-resist-desc = Greatly reduces incoming heat damage.

gene-space-adapt-name = Space adaptation
gene-space-adapt-desc = Pressure extremes no longer crush or burst the body.

gene-blind-name = Blindness
gene-blind-desc = Permanent blindness. The optic nerve is simply gone.

gene-clumsy-name = Clumsy
gene-clumsy-desc = Tools, guns, and tables become personal enemies.

gene-epilepsy-name = Epilepsy
gene-epilepsy-desc = Random seizures that drop the subject to the floor.

gene-cough-name = Nervous cough
gene-cough-desc = Uncontrollable coughing fits at the worst possible time.

gene-mute-name = Mute
gene-mute-desc = The vocal cords no longer work.

gene-weak-name = Weakness
gene-weak-desc = Takes more damage and hits softer. Conflicts with hulk.

gene-slow-name = Slowness
gene-slow-desc = Walking and sprinting are reduced. Conflicts with haste.

gene-cold-resist-name = Cold resistance
gene-cold-resist-desc = Greatly reduces incoming cold damage.

gene-rad-resist-name = Radiation resistance
gene-rad-resist-desc = Greatly reduces incoming radiation damage.

gene-no-slip-name = Sure footing
gene-no-slip-desc = The subject no longer slips on wet floors or banana peels.

gene-flash-proof-name = Flash immunity
gene-flash-proof-desc = Bright flashes no longer stun or blind the eyes.

gene-alcohol-proof-name = Alcohol tolerance
gene-alcohol-proof-desc = Booze barely registers. Conflicts with lightweight drunk.

gene-dermal-name = Dermal armor
gene-dermal-desc = Skin thickens against brute trauma. Blunt, slash, and piercing hurt less.

gene-narcolepsy-name = Narcolepsy
gene-narcolepsy-desc = The subject collapses into sudden naps at the worst times.

gene-nearsight-name = Nearsightedness
gene-nearsight-desc = Everything beyond arm's reach is a blur. Conflicts with blindness.

gene-paracusia-name = Paracusia
gene-paracusia-desc = The mind hears voices and noises that are not there.

gene-unrevivable-name = Genetic incompatibility
gene-unrevivable-desc = Defibrillators and revival tools refuse this genome.

gene-drunk-lite-name = Lightweight drunk
gene-drunk-lite-desc = A sip of alcohol hits like a bottle. Conflicts with alcohol tolerance.

gene-sneeze-name = Nervous sneeze
gene-sneeze-desc = Uncontrollable sneezing fits at the worst possible time.

gene-unstable-name = Unstable genome
gene-unstable-desc = Slightly more fragile cells and a large jump in genetic instability.

gene-pacifist-name = Pacifism
gene-pacifist-desc = Aggressive instincts are rewritten. Harming the living becomes almost impossible.

gene-mindlock-name = Conditioned loyalty
gene-mindlock-desc = The mind locks against conversion. Revolutionary and cult persuasion bounce off.

gene-hysteria-name = Nervous laughter
gene-hysteria-desc = The subject bursts into laughter without meaning to.

gene-pain-mute-name = Pain numbness
gene-pain-mute-desc = Nociceptors go quiet. Wounds hurt far less, and speech slurs when injured. Conflicts with hypersensitivity.

gene-sensitive-name = Hypersensitivity
gene-sensitive-desc = The nerves are raw. Blows, burns, and cuts land much harder. Conflicts with pain numbness.

gene-thermal-skin-name = Thermal skin
gene-thermal-skin-desc = The dermis buffers heat and cold transfer. Comfortable in wider temperatures.

gene-primal-form-name = Primal form
gene-primal-form-desc = The body collapses into another species. Which animal it becomes is unique to this shift.

gene-species-form-name = Xenogeneic form
gene-species-form-desc = The genome rewrites the whole body into another humanoid species.

gene-form-desc = The genome rewrites the body into this species, including that species' damage resistances. Sight stays clear. Assembled on the Morphology branch.

gene-bestial-tail-name = Bestial tail
gene-bestial-tail-desc = A tail erupts from the spine. Pattern and shape are rewritten every shift.

gene-cranial-horns-name = Cranial horns
gene-cranial-horns-desc = Horns burst from the skull. The exact pair is rolled with this shift's genome.

gene-moth-wings-name = Moth wings
gene-moth-wings-desc = Vestigial wings unfold from the back. Color and cut change each shift.

gene-aberrant-limb-name = Xenografted tissue
gene-aberrant-limb-desc = One body region is rewritten with another species' sprites: head, chest, an arm, or a leg. Which part and which race are unique to this shift.

gene-beast-desc = The genome collapses the body into this animal. It comes off only with the same combination.
gene-beast-cat-name = Feline form
gene-beast-mouse-name = Murine form
gene-beast-pig-name = Swine form
gene-beast-cow-name = Bovine form
gene-beast-goat-name = Caprine form
gene-beast-fox-name = Vulpine form
gene-beast-chicken-name = Galline form
gene-beast-duck-name = Anatine form
gene-beast-penguin-name = Penguin form
gene-beast-parrot-name = Parrot
gene-beast-crab-name = Crab form
gene-beast-hamster-name = Hamster form
gene-beast-goose-name = Goose form
gene-beast-butterfly-name = Butterfly
gene-beast-bat-name = Bat
gene-beast-bee-name = Bee form

gene-fauna-desc = The genome collapses the body into this fauna. The flesh keeps its natural weapons; the mind stays the subject's. It comes off only with the same combination.
gene-fauna-spider-name = Space spider
gene-fauna-dragon-name = Space dragon
gene-fauna-bear-name = Space bear
gene-fauna-carp-name = Space carp
gene-fauna-cobra-name = Space cobra
gene-fauna-goliath-name = Goliath
gene-fauna-watcher-name = Watcher
gene-fauna-xeno-name = Xeno runner
gene-fauna-shark-name = Sharkminnow

ent-MobGeneSpaceSpider = space spider
    .desc = It's so glowing, it looks dangerous.
ent-MobGeneSpaceDragon = space dragon
    .desc = A flying leviathan, loosely related to space carps. This one has no rift.
ent-MobGeneSpaceBear = space bear
    .desc = It looks friendly. Why don't you give it a hug?
ent-MobGeneSpaceCarp = space carp
    .desc = It's a space carp.
ent-MobGeneSpaceCobra = space cobra
    .desc = Long fangs and a glowing hood, and the alluring look begs to come closer.
ent-MobGeneGoliath = goliath
    .desc = A massive beast that uses long tentacles to ensnare its prey.
ent-MobGeneWatcher = watcher
    .desc = It's like it's staring right through you.
ent-MobGeneXenoRunner = runner
    .desc = They mostly come at night. Mostly.
ent-MobGeneShark = sharkminnow
    .desc = A dangerous shark from the blackness of endless space, who loves to drink blood.

gene-marking-extra-desc = The trait grows in on the body. Which pattern appears is rolled for this shift.
gene-ears-feline-name = Feline ears
gene-tail-feline-name = Feline tail
gene-ears-vulp-name = Vulpine ears
gene-tail-vulp-name = Vulpine tail
gene-horns-demon-name = Demon horns
gene-tail-harpy-name = Avian tail
gene-tail-resomi-name = Feathered tail
gene-snout-lizard-name = Reptile snout
gene-ears-cat-name = Housecat ears
gene-tail-cat-name = Housecat tail
gene-antennae-moth-name = Moth antennae

gene-vigor-name = Vigor
gene-vigor-desc = A deeper stamina pool that refills faster. Conflicts with lethargy.
gene-lethargy-name = Lethargy
gene-lethargy-desc = Less stamina, and it returns more slowly. Conflicts with vigor.
gene-tenacity-name = Tenacity
gene-tenacity-desc = Critical condition takes more damage to reach. Conflicts with glass jaw.
gene-glass-jaw-name = Glass jaw
gene-glass-jaw-desc = Critical condition arrives from less damage. Conflicts with tenacity.
gene-will-live-name = Will to live
gene-will-live-desc = Death waits longer: the fatal threshold is higher. Conflicts with will to die.
gene-will-die-name = Will to die
gene-will-die-desc = The fatal threshold is lower. Conflicts with will to live.
gene-thief-name = Nimble fingers
gene-thief-desc = Pockets and slots are stripped faster and more quietly.
gene-second-wind-name = Second wind
gene-second-wind-desc = The stamina reserve is noticeably larger.
gene-blast-padding-name = Blast padding
gene-blast-padding-desc = Explosive shock hits less hard.
gene-clinical-sight-name = Clinical sight
gene-clinical-sight-desc = Living creatures show health bars, as through a medical HUD.
gene-weightless-name = Weightlessness
gene-weightless-desc = The body barely feels gravity and drifts.

