genetics-console-journal-help = Uniquenesses expressed this shift. Printing does not need a subject in the scanner.
genetics-console-journal-print = Print activator
genetics-console-journal-clean = Print cleaner
genetics-console-journal-empty = Nothing expressed this shift — assemble a strand yourself.
